SUMMARY:Crafternoon at MTPL: Traditional German Paper Stars⭐
DESCRIPTION:Unwind and embrace a classic holiday crafting tradition! Join u
 s at the library to learn the art of weaving and folding 3D German paper s
 tars (also known as Fröbelsterne). Using four paper strips and a series o
 f clever folds\, you'll transform flat paper into intricate\, eye-catching
  stars perfect for holiday tree ornaments\, gift toppers\, or festive wind
 ow decorations. Whether you are an experienced paper crafter or completely
  new to the fold\, step-by-step guidance will be provided. All paper and s
 upplies are included-- just bring your patience and creativity!\n\nPrice: 
 Free\n\nSchedule listed: Dec 19\, 2026 · 01:00 PM EST – 03:00 PM EST\n\
 nSchedule supplied by Lancaster Libraries\n\nTimes converted from America/
